+arguments to pass on each go tool compile invocation.
+.RE
+.PP
+\f[B]\-installsuffix\f[R] \f[I]suffix\f[R]
+.RS
+.PP
+a suffix to use in the name of the package installation directory, in
+order to keep output separate from default builds.
+If using the \f[B]\-race\f[R] flag, the install suffix is automatically
