+Instead of absolute file system paths, the recorded file names will
+begin either a module path\(atversion (when using modules), or a plain
+import path (when using the standard library, or GOPATH).
+.RE
+.PP
+\f[B]\-toolexec\f[R] \f[I]`cmd args'\f[R]
+.RS
+.PP
+a program to use to invoke toolchain programs like vet and asm.
