+.TH "GO\-MOD" "1" "August 2026" "Go 1.27" "Go programming tools and commands"
+.SH NAME
+go\-mod \- module maintenance
+.SH SYNOPSIS
+\f[B]go mod\f[R] \f[I]command\f[R] [\f[I]arguments\f[R]]
+.SH DESCRIPTION
+Go mod provides access to operations on modules.
+.PP
+Note that support for modules is built into all the go commands, not
+just `go mod'.
+For example, day\-to\-day adding, removing, upgrading, and downgrading
+of dependencies should be done using `go get'.
+See `go help modules' for an overview of module functionality.
+.SH COMMANDS
+.TP
